<title>USA: Teledata Communications Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Teledata Communications Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.22	 profit   $0.07</p>
<p> Net profit	2,367	 profit   715</p>
<p> Revs		19,570		   10,050</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  10,708		   10,395</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.66	 loss     $0.11</p>
<p> Net profit	6,991	 loss     1,188</p>
<p> Revs		57,089		   32,127</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  10,527		   10,400</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Company based in Herzlia, Israel.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 results include $400,000 write-off for investment in  new subsidiary. Excluding the charge, net per share would have been $0.26.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
